  human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-27T01-39-10-946930Z.log:246:[recv] {"type": "message_end", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Role: You are an expert GraalVM reachability metadata engineer.\n\nTask:\nThe workflow already ran `./gradlew generateMetadata -Pcoordinates=com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5` over the tests written in the previous step. Check the traced metadata for `com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5` and add, by hand, only the reporter-requested entries that tracing did not produce.\n\nGenerated metadata for this coordinate lives under:\n`metadata/com.sun.xml.ws/rt-fi/4.0.5`\n\nOutput of the metadata generation the workflow just ran:\n```text\n> Task :tck-build-logic:extractPluginRequests UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:generatePluginAdapters UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:compileJava UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:compileGroovy UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:compileGroovyPlugins UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:pluginDescriptors UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:processResources UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:classes UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:jar UP-TO-DATE\n\n> Configure project :\nGraalVM Reachability Metadata TCK\n---------------------------------\n\n> Task :generateMetadata\n\u001b[34m[INFO] Generating metadata...\u001b[0m\n\u001b[34m[INFO] Performing metadata copy...\u001b[0m\n\u001b[34m[INFO] Merging generated metadata...\u001b[0m\n\n[Incubating] Problems report is available at: file:///home/oracle/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/forge_worktrees/9947-a7113c29/build/reports/problems/problems-report.html\n\nDeprecated Gradle features were used in this build, making it incompatible with Gradle 10.\n\nYou can use '--warning-mode all' to show the individual deprecation warnings and determine if they come from your own scripts or plugins.\n\nFor more on this, please refer to https://docs.gradle.org/9.1.0/