ull, new ByteArrayInputStream(new byte[0]), false);\\n        XMLStreamReader secondReader = factory.doCreate(\\n                null, new ByteArrayInputStream(new byte[0]), false);\\n        assertNotSame(firstReader, secondReader, \\\"An empty pool must create an independent reader\\\");\\n\\n        firstReader.close();\\n        factory.doRecycle(firstReader);\\n        XMLStreamReader recycledReader = factory.doCreate(\\n                null, new ByteArrayInputStream(new byte[0]), false);\\n\\n        assertSame(firstReader, recycledReader, \\\"The factory must reuse its thread-local reader\\\");\\n        recycledReader.close();\\n        secondReader.close();\\n    }\\n}\\n\"}\n27686:[recv] {\"type\": \"message_end\", \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"**Evaluating alternative feature for content type testing**\\n\\n**Identifying untested SOAP codec copy methods**\\n\\n**Assessing SOAP action content type testing challenges**\", \"thinkingSignature\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_017f6a45c9677fca016ab87101423887d29f9dd14094571338\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"content\\\":[],\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABquHEKww89RDbKXUn2VgkUL1zxrNpJgyikLOjgjGJZdiHBVLMZHKk4fMNkWsO1F5Y5dY6vP_9knTt8FeN00fG1BeFiTYiXzKTzAf_8G8GEyoeFruizxJNoZmapGelXM3Ud5jyw48G1enI0RYFxw2XLwu5sGiFlMLlKldPNCRDO7HfXCrffudB9dL1tBS0kNcsKBtfd-PKsNYHrRJEp8yg52MhOB847X0FlzPIPqlBfquCTZ4y5KMl7vn-IYGb60qbd_InjmKre990p75N5GAWyNbKag4onOE-s2hzvbM3GG6HSUSInO_angMI7jjVTorknW5mCcbygwbm-yNHjctU4sFKsyEcl7xNvDxJ6n4UAejTfRyMFdvRvcoAY1Xgi8JXJRmaXCZuyov_JSc_yyAivIQM6Wl8SxySKyDfbd04c5gGSIjokuOT2xpZZP3e0pJbj47wXdCPlXCQuU_cqU6Kk7knqZVYcQvDBtmzXp7D3j_vzMsYIWFkCDi-EnizPq1PciCxeetivdQ1-IQWSzhQ1Z48D1YGj-lGntxdzuGV0uRJ-R0wsGJjYO2RgYnEmvIP3P9EiASuOSrIMUyFZJX-dsaeDL7FEo6c_AGPivnAFGlxG_GJabHAU9a7ICJTJCJjnnelZTnnifvT3ikm8uMcGZsveCtWHXFN3DjiShfTgiS2v-qFKPCuA4_Cm-7O8eiDiawefnK8uwbHVPDKpopouZ4yyhfggGNZJfR52Gd9GgC8Uhv9DNLBiiQX1Jch__whXS0YGYqbMHi6VqVE0h7Lm0yehjXFHQ6lm-kKR