n directives are not permitted.\n\nThe metrics confirm that the workflow exhausted 24 iterations with status `failure`, no finalized metadata artifact, zero recorded generated LOC/metadata entries, and unavailable dynamic-access coverage.\n\nInspect:\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-09-27T01-41-23-322964Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-09-27T01-32-38-149689Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n- `stats/com.sun.xml.ws/rt-fi/4.0.5/execution-metrics.json`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Clean the coordinate’s build outputs and rerun `javaTest` and `nativeTestCompile` from the preserved branch to verify the currently preserved, narrowed tests rather than stale compiled classes.\n2. If the image-heap failure remains, use Native Image object-instantiation tracing for `Localizer`, `LocalizableMessageFactory`, and the reported Fast Infoset algorithm classes; determine whether the tests can avoid the problematic transitive JAX-WS path or whether this requires an upstream/GraalVM fix.\n3. After `nativeTestCompile` passes without prohibited initialization flags, regenerate metadata and the dynamic-access coverage report, then run the full coordinate-scoped test and validation tasks.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01496d913b8db93c016ab874b328d887d29e2854f2d2589d63\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 28412, "output": 1553, "cacheRead": 152576, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1005, "totalTokens": 182541, "cost": {"input": 0.113648, "output": 0.031060000000000004, "cacheRead": 0.061030400000000005, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.20573840000000002}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790473373914, "responseId": "resp_01496d913b8db93c016ab8749e1c7c87d2805365fb48f7b47d", "rawStopReason": "completed"